{
  "title": "The conditions of Salah",
  "pages": "35",
  "intro": "Twelve conditions: six before Salah and six during it.",
  "learn": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "html": "The <b>conditions of Salah</b> are what we must fulfil for our Salah to be right. There are <b>twelve</b>: six <b>before</b> Salah and six <b>during</b> Salah."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "6 before Salah – getting ready"
    },
    {
      "type": "cards",
      "items": [
        {
          "icon": "🧼",
          "label": "1. A clean body, clothes and place"
        },
        {
          "icon": "💧",
          "label": "2. Wudu – or ghusl if needed, or tayammum if there is no water"
        },
        {
          "icon": "👕",
          "label": "3. Being properly dressed"
        },
        {
          "icon": "🕐",
          "label": "4. Praying on time"
        },
        {
          "icon": "🕋",
          "label": "5. Facing the Qiblah"
        },
        {
          "icon": "💭",
          "label": "6. The niyyah – deciding to pray"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "6 during Salah – the parts of Salah"
    },
    {
      "type": "cards",
      "items": [
        {
          "icon": "🙌",
          "label": "1. Iftitah takbir – the opening takbir"
        },
        {
          "icon": "🧍",
          "label": "2. Qiyam – standing"
        },
        {
          "icon": "📖",
          "label": "3. Qira’ah – reciting the Qur’an"
        },
        {
          "icon": "🙇",
          "label": "4. Ruku‘ – bowing"
        },
        {
          "icon": "🛐",
          "label": "5. Sajdah – face to the ground"
        },
        {
          "icon": "🧎",
          "label": "6. Qa‘dah akhirah – the last sitting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "title": "⭐ Remember",
      "html": "6 + 6 = 12. Without all twelve conditions, Salah is <b>not right</b>!"
    }
  ],
